# Working draft under industry standards

Status fields may say Draft/Proposed. That means **content maturity**, not
“standards optional.”

| Standard / practice | Binding here |
| --- | --- |
| ISO/IEC/IEEE 29148-shaped RE | StRS/SRS/RTM shape; implementation-free REQ text |
| SEI ATAM QAS | Six-part scenarios before NFR→Design |
| Nygard ADR | Context/Decision/Status/Consequences |
| C4 | Context+Container before code; cite ADRs |
| Formal honesty | WASM/Rust trust-boundary ≠ unearned “proved” |

Keep REQ IDs stable; bump `last_reviewed` / status when amending Drafts.
